## Summary
Coursera has launched a pilot of Admin AI, a conversational analytics tool designed to reduce the burden of manual data analysis for learning leaders. This agentic experience aims to help them move from data to actionable decisions more efficiently.

## Key Points
- Admin AI is introduced as a pilot for a conversational analytics experience.
- It is purpose-built to minimize manual data analysis efforts.
- The tool targets learning leaders to facilitate data-driven decision-making.
- It leverages agentic AI to transform data into insights autonomously.
- Coursera is innovating in educational technology to enhance data utilization.


